abstract: >-
  RIME studies spectral, transport, accessibility, deformation, reporting,
  alignment, and bounded interpretation structures in finite-dimensional
  represented systems. This v2.0 repository snapshot contains the public
  Papers I-XIV contracts, manuscripts, accepted evidence, figures, and
  source-addressed validation material as of commit
  28711f67aee03b02786c8e9f451156576c0f65ef. Later v2.1 manuscript revisions,
  experiments, figures, tests, and contract candidates are excluded from this
  snapshot.
